        <mxCell id="ceNUwBN3d4AIJy9HWswp-3" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Functional Requirements&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- A user should be able to see all their accounts.&lt;br&gt;- A user should be able to see balances of the accounts associated with them.&lt;br&gt;- A user should be able to perform transfers to other accounts using recipient requisites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=20;" parent="1" vertex="1">
