        <mxCell id="ceNUwBN3d4AIJy9HWswp-43" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;User Service API&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- GET /api/v1/users/me - gets user&#39;s personal data based on claims of a provided JWT token.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- GET /api/v1/users/{user_id} - gets user&#39;s personal data by user_id path variable.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=20;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="385" y="-249" width="519" height="219" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ceNUwBN3d4AIJy9HWswp-44" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Account Service API&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- GET /api/v1/accounts - gets user&#39;s accounts based on claims of a provided JWT token.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- GET /api/v1/accounts/{account_id} - gets user&#39;s account based on account_id&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;path variable&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- GET /api/v1/accounts/{account_id}/transactions - gets user account&#39;s transactions based on account_id path variable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- POST /api/v1/accounts - creates user&#39;s account.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- POST /api/v1/transactions - creates a transaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- GET /api/v1/transactions/{transaction_id} - gets transactions by its id.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=20;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="385" y="-12" width="552" height="474" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ceNUwBN3d4AIJy9HWswp-51" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Spreading ledger transactions and account entities across multiple services would require complex synchronization logic between those services and could make balance updates eventually consistent. Instead, account and ledger entities are located in the same service, which allows to keep account and ledger logic&amp;nbsp; within the same database transaction boundary to preserve strong consistency and reduce complexity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="551" y="1416" width="481" height="243" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3FdnPUbXrfRIRAWf-1F0-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Account Database is not sharded. The main reason is that there is no sharding strategy that wouldn&#39;t result in implementing 2PC or eventual consistency. If account_id is the sharding key, then it may engage more than one shard (instance of the database) into transaction processing, when there is financial transaction between two accounts located on different shards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;There are two main strategies to keep two shards consistent:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Two-Phase Commit (2PC). Strong Consistency, High Latency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Asynchronous processing. Eventual Consistency, Low Latency. Usually, this approach is forbidden for financial operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="965" y="861" width="582" height="331" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3FdnPUbXrfRIRAWf-1F0-3" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Non-Functional Requirements&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- A system should be strongly consistent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-201" y="-2" width="537" height="242" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3FdnPUbXrfRIRAWf-1F0-4" value="DB&lt;div&gt;Read Replica&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=20;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1415" y="1411" width="128" height="128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3FdnPUbXrfRIRAWf-1F0-5" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;rounded=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=16;startSize=14;endArrow=open;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;curved=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1259" y="1313" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1389" y="1402" as="targetPoint" />
            <Array as="points" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3FdnPUbXrfRIRAWf-1F0-6" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Data is being synchronously replicated to another replica to ensure better durability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1389" y="1236.5" width="270" height="139" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3FdnPUbXrfRIRAWf-1F0-8" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;rounded=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=16;startSize=14;endArrow=open;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;curved=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="775" y="1200" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="470" y="700" as="targetPoint" />
            <Array as="points" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3FdnPUbXrfRIRAWf-1F0-9" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Checks user&#39;s eligibility for account creation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="633" y="851" width="234" height="99" as="geometry" />
